# No environment variables are required for vitaldesignsource.com.
# Production defaults, private storage, and a persistent random rate-limit key
# are configured automatically. Keep optional overrides commented unless needed.
#
# Different domain (use the same origin at build time and runtime):
# SITE_URL=https://your-domain.example
# NODE_ENV=production
#
# Optional storage override: use a private persistent absolute path.
# DATABASE_PATH=/private/persistent/path/inquiries.sqlite
# Optional secret override: use at least 32 random characters.
# RATE_LIMIT_SECRET=replace-with-your-random-secret
# Set only after verifying exactly one trusted proxy replaces forwarded headers:
# TRUST_PROXY=1
#
# Inquiry email destination defaults to Vitaldesignsource@gmail.com.
# Email delivery requires the real sending account below; inquiries are saved
# privately and queued for retry until sending is configured and succeeds.
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.your-provider.example
# SMTP_PORT=465
# SMTP_USER=your-provider-user
# SMTP_PASS=your-provider-secret
# INQUIRY_FROM=Studio <verified-sender@your-domain.example>
# Optional only when deliberately changing the destination:
# INQUIRY_TO=Vitaldesignsource@gmail.com
